<title>NETHERLANDS: ING 1996 net profit 3.32 bln guilders.</title>
<headline>ING 1996 net profit 3.32 bln guilders.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996 year.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit (billions)		 3.32 vs   2.65</p>
<p>    Net per share (guilders)	    4.56 vs   3.84</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		   2.00 vs   1.66</p>
<p>Note - Analysts had forecast that ING Groep NV would report a 1996 net profit of between 3.17 billion and 3.36 billion guilders, or an average of 3.22 billion.  </p>
<p>    Pre-tax banking profit (blns)     2.13 vs   1.75</p>
